        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>plant tissue (related)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>植物組織の一部 (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
